				"_note": "DBA CLIENT STATEMENT (the opdrachtgeversverklaring that fixes the freelancer relationship and its false-self-employment risk). The body carries the assignment, term, model agreement, risk assessment and the generated statement-document link. The existing generate-document action + lifecycleActions confirm the agreement and produce the doc via docudesk. It is a compliance artefact, not correspondence, so no email/calendar; the audit trail sidebar is the who-signed-off record for a labour-law document.",
